'' A CHAIN WITH A USTRING TERM IS A USTRING CHAIN, passed to a 'byref as ustring' parameter
'' as much as assigned. Measured, fbc builds '"exactly " & wchr( 34 ) & wanted & ...' with
'' fb_UStrConcat alone, the literals and the wchr as UTF-16. The wchr sent tiko down the WIDE
'' route, which passed wanted's UTF-16 descriptor to fb_WstrConcatWA as narrow text: "VFV"
'' came out "V", and ApexWealth's symbol-lookup error no longer named the symbol.
